From 14d5521b884e693d0c62c64fc930fbc7cbe8a7fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hansem Ro <hansemro@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jan 2024 06:06:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] [Preview] Add MBIA04X/MBI504X RGB and LED Matrix Driver

Aims to target MBIA043/MBIA045/MBI5042/MBI5043 LED drivers with
proprietary SPI-like control interface.

This driver attempts to support as many different configurations
possible including:
- custom MBI output channel <-> color channel mapping
- custom LED Matrix to LED Index table
    - we should not assume Key and LED Matrices match

This driver requires PWM and GPT drivers. PWM driver operates the GCLK
clock signal. GPT driver periodically flushes a row or column color data
to MBI buffers.

